sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant P as ModelDetailPage (`IC-11`)
  participant A as AnalyticsEmitter
  participant GA as GA4
  participant R as NextRouter
  participant D as DealerLocator page

  V->>P: Click "Find a dealer"
  P->>P: Confirm CTA enabled & build query with model slug
  alt Consent granted
    P->>A: emit model_dealer_cta_click {model_slug, locale}
    A-->>GA: POST measurement payload
  else Consent denied
    P->>A: skip emit; log consent=false
  end
  P->>R: router.push(`/dealers?model={slug}`)
  R->>D: Render dealer locator with pre-selected model context
